      "side": 1,
      "message": "It does: https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/extra/um_ppm/rts5453.c;l\u003d607\n\nYou\u0027ve got this check above:\n```\nif (control-\u003ecommand \u003d\u003d 0 || control-\u003ecommand \u003e UCSI_CMD_VENDOR_CMD) {\n\t\tLOG_ERR(\"Invalid command 0x%x\", control-\u003ecommand);\n\t\treturn -1;\n\t}\n```\n\n(though this check needs to be expanded as GET_LPM_PPM_INFO comes after UCSI_CMD_VENDOR_CMD)",
